  "title": "Sliced Steak, Peppers, and Mushrooms in the Oven",
  "description": "For this recipe, cook flank steak in the oven with onions, peppers, mushrooms, and tomatoes. Serve it with rice, noodles, or potatoes for a fast meal.",
